OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors' emails unacceptable,
OL,4,Asays CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council boss has lambasted
OL,7,Fcouncillors over "unacceptable" emails
OL,8,Fsent in the past week which could pose
OL,9,Fa "significant legal risk" to the local
OL,10,Fauthority.
OL,12,FDurham County Council chief executive
OL,13,FJohn Hewitt said in an email to all its
OL,14,Fcouncillors he had never seen such
OL,15,Fbehaviour in the more than 35 years he
OL,16,Fhad worked in local government.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
