OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors' emails unacceptable,
OL,4,Asays CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FHewitt did not detail what exactly was
OL,7,Fsaid in the emails but said they
OL,8,Finvolved presenting "personal views,
OL,9,Fallegations and assumptions" about
OL,10,Fcouncil staff and other councillors as
OL,11,Fthough they were fact.
OL,13,FA subset of the emails seen by the BBC
OL,14,Finvolve those from multiple political
OL,15,Faffiliations arguing with each other.
